---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
const built = new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 16).replace('T', ' ');
---

<footer class="site-footer">
	<div class="container inner">
		<div class="left">
			<div class="brand mono"><span class="ok">●</span> all systems operational</div>
			<p>© {year} suyeon · 화면부터 서버까지, 끝까지 책임지는 웹개발자</p>
		</div>
		<div class="right mono">
			<a href="/rss.xml">rss</a>
			<a href="https://github.com/sychae2091" target="_blank" rel="noopener">github</a>
			<span class="build">build {built} UTC</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>

<style>
	.site-footer {
		margin-top: 120px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
		background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-elev) 60%, transparent);
	}
	.inner {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 24px;
		padding-top: 28px;
		padding-bottom: 36px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.brand {
		font-size: 12.5px;
		color: var(--muted);
	}
	.ok {
		color: var(--accent-3);
	}
	p {
		margin: 6px 0 0;
		font-size: 14px;
		color: var(--muted);
	}
	.right {
		display: flex;
		gap: 18px;
		font-size: 12.5px;
		color: var(--muted);
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.right a:hover {
		color: var(--accent);
	}
</style>
